      "de": "Originale Demonstrationsformel POISON 226111 von Fraterworks (fraterworks.com). Profil: Blumige Komposition. Schlüsselkomponenten der Struktur: Ylang Ylang Extra Oil, Comoros, Cascarilla Bark Oil, Geranium Bourbon “Superior” Oil, Tarragon Oil."
