    "description": {
      "ru": "Оригинальная демонстрационная формула CHYPRE 246057 от Fraterworks (fraterworks.com). Профиль: женская классическая композиция. Ключевые компоненты структуры: Jasmine Grandiflorum Absolute, Bergamot “Superior” Oil FCF, Patchouli Dark Aged PA30, Sandalwood Mysore “Signature” Oil.",
      "en": "Original Fraterworks demonstration formula CHYPRE 246057 (a feminine fragrance) from fraterworks.com. Built around Jasmine Grandiflorum Absolute, Bergamot “Superior” Oil FCF, Patchouli Dark Aged PA30, Sandalwood Mysore “Signature” Oil. Note: twelve weeks then chill overnight before filtering.",
      "it": "Formula dimostrativa originale CHYPRE 246057 di Fraterworks (fraterworks.com). Profilo: composizione classica femminile. Componenti chiave della struttura: Jasmine Grandiflorum Absolute, Bergamot “Superior” Oil FCF, Patchouli Dark Aged PA30, Sandalwood Mysore “Signature” Oil.",
      "es": "Fórmula demostrativa original CHYPRE 246057 de Fraterworks (fraterworks.com). Perfil: composición clásica femenina. Componentes clave de la estructura: Jasmine Grandiflorum Absolute, Bergamot “Superior” Oil FCF, Patchouli Dark Aged PA30, Sandalwood Mysore “Signature” Oil.",
      "de": "Originale Demonstrationsformel CHYPRE 246057 von Fraterworks (fraterworks.com). Profil: Klassische Damenkomposition. Schlüsselkomponenten der Struktur: Jasmine Grandiflorum Absolute, Bergamot “Superior” Oil FCF, Patchouli Dark Aged PA30, Sandalwood Mysore “Signature” Oil."
    },
    "studyTip": {
      "ru": "Формула №106 из официальной библиотеки Fraterworks (38 комп., сумма 3000 ч.). Используйте масштабирование веса концентрата для автоматического пересчёта граммов под ваш флакон.",
      "en": "Formula #106 from the official Fraterworks library (38 materials, total 3000 parts). Scale to your target concentrate weight in one click.",
      "it": "Formula #106 dall’archivio ufficiale Fraterworks (38 componenti, somma 1000 parti). Può essere scalata nella scheda del progetto in un clic.",
      "es": "Fórmula #106 del archivo oficial de Fraterworks (38 componentes, suma 1000 partes). Se puede escalar a tu peso objetivo en un clic.",
      "de": "Formel #106 aus dem offiziellen Fraterworks-Archiv (38 Rohstoffe, Summe 1000 Teile). Mit einem Klick auf das Zielgewicht im Projekt skalierbar."
    },
